"<para>The applet shows results for one of them at a time. To switch the currently used stop setting use the context menu of the applet.</para>"
"<para>For each stop setting another filter configuration can be used. To edit filter configurations use the <interface>Filter</interface> section in the settings dialog. You can define a list of stops for each stop setting that are then displayed combined (eg. stops near to each other).</para>"
